*IMG_NAME_3 Animator\2D_HUD_Icons\Indicator_Lamp\RectangleLIGHT_OFF.dds
*IMG_NAME_4 Animator\2D_HUD_Icons\Indicator_Lamp\RectangleLIGHT_OFF.dds

#Selection 18 for Icon 0
